se border-black" data-filter-date="2027-02-28"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">28 February</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">28 Feb</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-03-23"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">23 March</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">23 Mar</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-03-28"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">28 March</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">28 Mar</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-04-22"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">22 April</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">22 Apr</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-04-25"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">25 April</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">25 Apr</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-05-05"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">05 May</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">05 May</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-05-09"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">09 May</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">09 May</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-05-25"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">25 May</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">25 May</span></a></li><li class="nav-item mx-1 date-page d-none"><a class="filter-item nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black" data-filter-date="2027-05-30"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">30 May</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none">30 May</span></a></li></ul><!-- Next button --><button class="nav-link ps-1 ps-lg-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black ms-lg-2" id="nextDates">&raquo;</button></div></div><script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
  var wrapper = document.getElementById("dateFilterWrapper");
  var tabs = document.querySelectorAll("#dateFilterTabs .date-page");
  var prevBtn = document.getElementById("prevDates");
  var nextBtn = document.getElementById("nextDates");

  var showId = wrapper ? parseInt(wrapper.getAttribute("data-show-id"), 10) || 0 : 0;

  // no dates at all: remove the whole filter (the JSP omitted it entirely)
  if (!tabs.length) {
    if (wrapper) wrapper.remove();
    return;
  }

  // first tab is the active one

  window.addEventListener("load", function () {
    if (!document.querySelector("#dateFilterTabs .filter-item.active")) {
        console.log("clicking!");

        tabs[0].querySelector(".filter-item").click();
    }
});

  var currentPage = 0;

  function getPerPage() {
    var perPage = window.innerWidth < 1200 ? 3 : 4;
    if (showId > 0) { perPage = 3; }
    return perPage;
  }

  var perPage = getPerPage();

  function updatePage() {
    perPage = getPerPage();
    tabs.forEach(function(tab, i) {
      var start = currentPage * perPage;
      var end = start + perPage;
      tab.classList.toggle("d-none", i < start || i >= end);
    });

    var isAtStart = currentPage === 0;
    var isAtEnd = (currentPage + 1) * perPage >= tabs.length;

    prevBtn.disabled = isAtStart;
    nextBtn.disabled = isAtEnd;
    prevBtn.classList.toggle("opacity-50", isAtStart);
    nextBtn.classList.toggle("opacity-50", isAtEnd);
    prevBtn.classList.toggle("pointer-events-none", isAtStart);
    nextBtn.classList.toggle("pointer-events-none", isAtEnd);
  }

  function handleResize() {
    var newPerPage = getPerPage();
    if (newPerPage !== perPage) {
      perPage = newPerPage;
      currentPage = 0;
      updatePage();
    }
  }

  prevBtn.addEventListener("click", function() {
    if (currentPage > 0) { currentPage--; updatePage(); }
  });

  nextBtn.addEventListener("click", function() {
    if ((currentPage + 1) * perPage < tabs.length) { currentPage++; updatePage(); }
  });

  window.addEventListener("resize", handleResize);

  updatePage();
});
</script><div class="col-2 d-flex justify-content-end align-items-center "><ul class="nav nav-tabs border-0"><li class="nav-item mx-1"><a class="nav-link px-3 py-0 text-uppercase border-black d-flex align-items-center" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modal-filter"><span class="d-none d-md-inline">Filter</span><i class="uil uil-sliders-v-alt ms-md-2 fs-14"></i></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="films"><!-- OPEN films wrapper --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-11-05 20:00:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/nova-laughs.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/NovaLaughs_Web.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/NovaLaughs_Web.jpg" alt="Nova Laughs" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/nova-laughs.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/NovaLaughs_Web.jpg" alt="Nova Laughs" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-18.png" alt="18 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/nova-laughs.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Nova Laughs<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-18.png" alt="18 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>12