 principal members of the original Broadway cast&#x2014;Reeve Carney, Andr&eacute; De Shields, Amber Gray, Eva Noblezada, and Patrick Page&#x2014;reunite on the West End for this reinterpretation of timeless love stories from Greek mythology.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A West End reinterpretation of Greek love stories featuring the original Broadway cast.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-13"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Tuesday 13 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-13 genredrama genremusic genreromance cert-certificate12a" data-date="2026-10-13"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">Flash, AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a7c782dc32da88df3c33bba" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-18"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Sunday 18 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-18 genredrama genremusic genreromance cert-certificate12a" data-date="2026-10-18"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">3:30 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5<