umbs/RBONutcracker_WebPoster.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBONutcracker_WebPoster.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: The Nutcracker" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-the-nutcracker.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBONutcracker_WebPoster.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: The Nutcracker" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-the-nutcracker.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: The Nutcracker<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>140<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops. 
Peter Wright&#x2019;s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of Tchaikovsky&#x2019;s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman&#x2019;s period designs. </p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A magical production of 'The Nutcracker' by the Royal Ballet &amp; Opera, showcasing stunning choreography and Tchaikovsky's iconic score.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-12-01"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Tuesday 01 Dec</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-12-01  cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-12-01"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:15 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a88785dc9d9203ed7ed67eb" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-12-13"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Sunday 13 Dec</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-12-13  cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-12-13"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a8db91bab5733f7567fb16c" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --></div><!-- /.film-days --></div><!-- /col-lg-6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey455" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey455">Key</button><div id="sessionKey455" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2027-02-03 16:45:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-mmerung.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/RBOGotterdammarung_webposter.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBOGotterdammarung_webposter.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: G&ouml;tterd&auml;mmerung" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-mmerung.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBOGotterdammarung_webposter.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: G&ouml;tterd&auml;mmerung" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-mmerung.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: G&ouml;tterd&auml;mmerung<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>350<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">An earth in ruin. The twilight of the Gods. 
Deception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Br&uuml;nnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved&#x2019;s innocence, Br&uuml;nnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. For the long-awaited finale of Wagner&#x2019;s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary world of dream-like turmoil. Antonio Pappano, Conductor Laureate of The Royal Opera, returns to take on the impassioned, otherworldly music &#x2013; including Siegfried&#x2019;s transporting Funeral March and Br&uuml;nnhilde&#x2019;s electrifying Immolation Scene. The brilliant cast is led by Elisabet Strid, Andreas Schager and Mika Kares, who together with the full forces of the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House and the Royal Opera Chorus bring opera&#x2019;s greatest journey to its shattering end. 
</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A stunning performance of Wagner's epic opera 'G&ouml;tterd&auml;mmerung' by the Royal Ballet &amp; Opera.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2027-02-03"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Wednesday 03 Feb</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2027-02-03  cert-certificate15" data-date="2027-02-03"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">4:45 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a8db8be2c32a23ec04d82db" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2027-02-07"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Sunday 07 Feb</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2027-02-07  cert-certificate15" data-date="2027-02-07"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a887ab5d1af2269e687fad4" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-bloc