lass="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2027-05-05 19:00:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-tosca.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/RBOTosca_webposter.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBOTosca_webposter.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: Tosca" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-tosca.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBOTosca_webposter.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: Tosca" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-tosca.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: Tosca<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>195<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia&#x2019;s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?
Oliver Mears&#x2019;s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini&#x2019;s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A captivating production of Puccini's classic opera Tosca, showcasing love and betrayal through powerful performances.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2027-05-05"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Wednesday 05 May</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2027-05-05  cert-certificate15" data-date="2027-05-05"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a8db8542ad9d87ec78aab8f" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2027-05-09"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Sunday 09 May</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2027-05-09  cert-certificate15" data-date="2027-05-09"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a8d9868fdba43018be372a1" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --></div><!-- /.film-days --></div><!-- /col-lg-6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey470" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey470">Key</button><div id="sessionKey470" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2027-04-22 19:15:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-swan-lake.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/RBOSwanLake_webposter.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBOSwanLake_webposter.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: Swan Lake" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-swan-lake.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/RBOSwanLake_webposter.jpg" alt="Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: Swan Lake" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/royal-ballet-and-opera-2026-27-swan-lake.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Royal Ballet &amp; Opera 2026/27: Swan Lake<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>205<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Princess Odette is bound by a curse, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and pledges to free her. But freedom is not promised for Odette as Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers&#x2019; plans.
Liam Scarlett&#x2019;s production for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky&#x2019;s towering score and John Macfarlane&#x2019;s picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet spectacle of love, treachery and forgiveness.  </p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A mesmerizing performance of Tchaikovsky's 'Swan Lake' by the Royal Ballet, showcasing love and transformation.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2027-04-22"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Thursday 22 Apr</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2027-04-22  cert-certificate15" data-date="2027-04-22"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:15 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6a8d986b8b058eb861668418" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2027-04-25"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Sunday 25 Apr</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2027-04-25  cert-certificate15" data-date="2027-04-25"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><