rounded-0"><a href="/shows/verity.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/yAmkYfM9Xwq1TfnIXPCW61cSMrL.jpg" alt="Verity" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/verity.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Verity<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>117<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="117"> |</span><span> Thriller, Mystery</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Lowen Ashleigh is hired by Jeremy Crawford to ghostwrite novels for his bestselling author wife Verity, who is unable to finish following an accident. Lowen gradually uncovers Verity's disturbing truths while residing at the Crawfords' home to work.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A ghostwriter uncovers disturbing truths about an incapacitated author while living in her home.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-12"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Monday 12 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-12 genrethriller genremystery cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-10-12"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">5:15 p