rc="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-U.png" alt="U Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/english-national-ballet-presents-the-sleeping-beauty.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">English National Ballet presents The Sleeping Beauty<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-U.png" alt="U Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>160<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="160"> |</span><span> Fantasy, Romance</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">A spellbinding fairytale ballet filmed at London&#x2019;s Royal Albert Hall.  Sir Kenneth MacMillan&#x2019;s exquisite ballet will leave you spellbound. A stunning version of one of the world&#x2019;s favourite fairytales, filmed at London&#x2019;s Royal Albert Hall.  Featuring First Soloist Anna Nevzorova as Aurora and Davi Ramos as Prince D&eacute;sir&eacute;, the film will whisk you away to an enchanted land and a story of good versus evil. As a baby, Princess Aurora is cursed by the wicked Carabosse (Eireen Evrard). Her godmother, the Lilac Fairy (Anri Sugiura), alters the spell so Aurora will not die, but sleep for 100 years. Only a true love&#x2019;s kiss can awaken her.  From Aurora&#x2019;s christening in the palace, to her jubilant wedding, the bewitching tale is brought to life before your eyes through beautiful choreography, sumptuous costumes and stunning new projection sets by Charlotte MacMillan.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A breathtaking ballet adaptation of 'The Sleeping Beauty' filmed at the Royal Albert Hall, showcasing stunning choreography and a timeless fairytale.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-14"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Wednesday 14 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-14 genrefantasy genreromance cert-certificateu" data-date="2026-10-14"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags"></div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ab0fbee5277ec6058667ed0" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --></div><!-- /.film-days --></div><!-- /col-lg-6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey575" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey575">Key</button><div id="sessionKey575" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-10-16 13:30:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/forgotten-island.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/ForgottenIsland_WebPoster.png" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/ForgottenIsland_WebPoster.png" alt="Forgotten Island" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/forgotten-island.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/ForgottenIsland_WebPoster.png" alt="Forgotten Island" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-pg.png" alt="PG Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/forgotten-island.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Forgotten Island<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-pg.png" alt="PG Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>109<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="109"> |</span><span> Fantasy, Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">Two best friends must save their memories to escape a magical island before they forget each other forever.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-16"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Friday 16 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-16 genrefantasy genreanimation genrefamily genrecomedy genreadventure cert-certificatepg" data-date="2026-10-16"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">1:30 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 4</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac65a3e04c7d5baee1418fe" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-16 genrefantasy genreanimation genrefamily genrecomedy genreadventure cert-certificatepg" data-date="2026-10-16"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">4:15 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 4</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac