1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-10-16 14:15:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/street-fighter.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/StreetFighter_WebPoster.png" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/StreetFighter_WebPoster.png" alt="Street Fighter" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/street-fighter.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/StreetFighter_WebPoster.png" alt="Street Fighter" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12A.png" alt="12A Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/street-fighter.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Street Fighter<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12A.png" alt="12A Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>119<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="119"> |</span><span> Fantasy, Action</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">Ryu and Ken are recruited for a brutal tournament, facing each other and their past demons amidst a deadly conspiracy.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-16"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Friday 16 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-16 genrefantasy genreaction cert-certificate12a" data-date="2026-10-16"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:15 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac663617cf12206dcd037ba" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-16 genrefantasy genreaction cert-certificate12a" data-date="2026-10-16"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-bla