ne d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="108"> |</span><span> Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self&#x2026; but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A disfigured actor seeks revenge after an experimental treatment restores his former self but distorts his reality.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-23"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Friday 23 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-23 genrethriller genrehorror genresciencefiction cert-certificate18" data-date="2026-10-23"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:45 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 1</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">4K, ATMOS, AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac64dd25b8b44002ff35a67" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-23 genrethriller genrehorror genresciencefiction cert-certificate18" data-date="2026-10-23"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-gro