6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey622" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey622">Key</button><div id="sessionKey622" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-12-15 19:00:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/dune-part-three-preview.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/b4wekkUaxExzOeGe7hKXzhnyXHt.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/b4wekkUaxExzOeGe7hKXzhnyXHt.jpg" alt="Dune: Part Three | Preview" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/dune-part-three-preview.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/b4wekkUaxExzOeGe7hKXzhnyXHt.jpg" alt="Dune: Part Three | Preview" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12A.png" alt="12A (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/dune-part-three-preview.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Dune: Part Three | Preview<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12A.png" alt="12A (TBC) Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>140<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="140"> |</span><span> Science Fiction, Adventure</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Nearly two decades after he seized control of the Imperium, Paul Atreides is now a ruthless Emperor, and must face the consequences of his reign as old allies return, terrifying new threats emerge, and betrayal lurks in every shadow. Haunted by visions of Imperial collapse and the reappearance of his long-lost love, Paul is drawn into a sweeping conspiracy, with Chani at the heart of its unfolding mystery. As enemies close in, Paul must confront the true cost of power and the fate of those he loves the most.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">Paul Atreides faces the consequences of his reign as a ruthless Emperor in a world filled with betrayal and conspiracy.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-12-15"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Tuesday 15 Dec</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-12-15 genresciencefiction genreadventure cert-certificate12a" data-date="2026-12-15"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 1</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">4K, ATMOS, AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac671719ba79a545edf6ba3" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --></div><!-- /.film-days --></div><!-- /col-lg-6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey626" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey626">Key</button><div id="sessionKey626" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-10-28 19:45:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/ozzy-and-black-sabbath-back-to-the-beginning.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/Ozzy_WebPoster.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/Ozzy_WebPoster.jpg" alt="Ozzy &amp; Black Sabbath: Back to the Beginning " /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/ozzy-and-black-sabbath-back-to-the-beginning.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/Ozzy_WebPoster.jpg" alt="Ozzy &amp; Black Sabbath: Back to the Beginning " /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-18.png" alt="18 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/ozzy-and-black-sabbath-back-to-the-beginning.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Ozzy &amp; Black Sabbath: Back to the Beginning <i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-18.png" alt="18 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>147<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="147"> |</span><span> Documentary, Music</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">OZZY &amp; BLACK SABBATH: BACK TO THE BEGINNING documents a landmark
moment in music history: Ozzy Osbourne&#x2019;s historic final farewell performance
for his fans at Villa Park stadium in his Birmingham hometown--captured just
17 days before his untimely passing. The film highlights the historic day with
performances from Ozzy, Black Sabbath, and some of the most influential
names in rock, along with personal reflections from the superstar musicians
they inspired and a behind-the-scenes look at the day itself.
This is an historic and intimate farewell to Ozzy and the band that changed
music forever.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">Relive Ozzy Osbourne's historic final performance at Villa Park in Birmingham with performances from Ozzy, Black Sabbath and a host of incredible guests.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-28"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Wednesday 28 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-28 genredocumentary genremusic cert-certificate18" data-date="2026-10-28"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:45 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 7</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">Recliner</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac763754534c19272b7e5eb" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-29"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Thursday 29 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-29 genredocumentary genremusic cert-certificate18" data-date="2026-10-29"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:45 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 7</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">Recliner</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac76081af572ea2a12f994c" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 bord