ol-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/godzilla-minus-zero.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/GMZ_WebPoster.png" alt="Godzilla Minus Zero" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12.png" alt="12 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/godzilla-minus-zero.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Godzilla Minus Zero<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12.png" alt="12 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>135<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="135"> |</span><span> Action, Horror, Science Fiction</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">Japan struggles to recover from war and Godzilla's wrath, only to face a new threat that crushes their hard-won peace.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-11-06"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Friday 06 Nov</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border m