ap-2">I Play Rocky | Preview<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-12.png" alt="12 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>128<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="128"> |</span><span> Drama, History</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">The electrifying true story about an unknown actor with an unshakable belief that he wasn't just meant to write Rocky&#x2014;he was meant to be Rocky Balboa. Told "no" at every turn, Sylvester Stallone bets everything on himself, holding the line on playing the lead against seemingly impossible odds.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">An inspiring true story of Sylvester Stallone's relentless pursuit to play Rocky Balboa against all odds.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-11-11"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Wednesday 11 Nov</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-11-11 genredrama genrehistory cert-certificate12a" data-date="2026-11-11"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">8:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 3</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac7abbdf4f48a08f4247039" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-11-12"><!-- OPEN day-b