lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/wicker.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/Wicker_Webposter.png" alt="Wicker" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/wicker.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Wicker<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>105<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="105"> |</span><span> Fantasy, Comedy, Romance</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">On the outskirts of a village by the sea, lives a Fisherwoman; smelly, single and perpetually ridiculed. One day, fed up with her stuffy, small-minded neighbours, she commissions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise conservative town, this unconventional romance sparks outrage, jealousy and chaos.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A Fisherwoman crafts a wicker husband, sparking chaos in her conservative village.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-10-30"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Friday 30 Oct</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-10-30 genrefantasy genrecomedy genreromance cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-10-30"