href="/shows/v-for-vendetta-20th-anniversary.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/1avD1JeaRiJX5M4ahPdZPypGoGN.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/1avD1JeaRiJX5M4ahPdZPypGoGN.jpg" alt="V for Vendetta (20th Anniversary)" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/v-for-vendetta-20th-anniversary.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/1avD1JeaRiJX5M4ahPdZPypGoGN.jpg" alt="V for Vendetta (20th Anniversary)" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/v-for-vendetta-20th-anniversary.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">V for Vendetta (20th Anniversary)<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-15-1.png" alt="15 Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>132<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="132"> |</span><span> Action, Thriller, Science Fiction</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">In a world in which Great Britain has become a fascist state, a masked vigilante known only as &ldquo;V&rdquo; conducts guerrilla warfare against the oppressive British government. When V rescues a young woman from the secret police, he finds in her an ally with whom he can continue his fight to free the people of Britain.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A masked vigilante fights against a fascist regime in Great Britain, recruiting a young woman to aid in his rebellion.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-11-05"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Thursday 05 Nov</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-11-05 genreaction genrethriller genresciencefiction cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-11-05"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">8:00 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 7</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">Recliner, AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac8ad1fc49249f6ed159474" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --></div><!-- /.film-days --></div><!-- /col-lg-6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey634" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey634">Key</button><div id="sessionKey634" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</di