-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="116"> |</span><span> Crime, Thriller, Comedy</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their bureau chief, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send everyone&#x2019;s trip to this remote paradise sideways.</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">CIA agents navigate personal and political turmoil in 1973 Chile as they embark on a mission to Easter Island.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-11-06"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Friday 06 Nov</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-11-06 genrecrime genrethriller genrecomedy cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-11-06"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">2:15 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 5</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac8aebae3841b64277ebc17" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-11-06 genrecrime genrethriller genrecomedy cert-certificate15" data-date="2026-11-06"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">5:15 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm