 id="sessionKey635" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-11-10 19:30:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/rocky-50th-anniversary.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/eeUqKTX0YYw3T53rjYQMKOwf0TF.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/eeUqKTX0YYw3T53rjYQMKOwf0TF.jpg" alt="Rocky (50th Anniversary)" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div class="col-lg-6 col-12"><!-- OPEN synopsis col --><div class="row mb-3"><div class="col-5 d-lg-none"><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/rocky-50th-anniversary.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/eeUqKTX0YYw3T53rjYQMKOwf0TF.jpg" alt="Rocky (50th Anniversary)" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><div class="col-7 col-lg-12"><h4 class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-24 fs-md-32"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-pg.png" alt="PG Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-none d-md-block" /><a href="/shows/rocky-50th-anniversary.html" class="fw-bold text-black text-decoration-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2">Rocky (50th Anniversary)<i class="uil uil-arrow-up-right text-primary fs-20"></i></a></h4><div class="fs-16 lh-base mb-3 text-black"><img src="/cmsUploads/certificate/images/certificate-pg.png" alt="PG Certificate" style="width:32px;height:32px;" class="d-md-none me-1" /><span>120<span class="d-none d-md-inline"> Minutes</span><span class="d-inline d-md-none"> Mins</span></span><span data-rt="120"> |</span><span> Drama</span></div><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-none d-lg-inline">Rocky Balboa is a Philadelphia club fighter who seems to be going nowhere. But when a stroke of fate puts him in the ring with a world heavyweight champion, Rocky knows that it's his one shot at the big time &#x2014; a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to go the distance and come out a winner!</p><p class="mb-3 fs-16 lh-base d-lg-none">A struggling Philadelphia boxer gets a once-in-a-lifetime chance to fight the heavyweight champion.</p></div></div><div class="film-days"><!-- OPEN film-days --><div class="day-block w-100" data-date="2026-11-10"><!-- OPEN day-block --><div style="position:relative;"><div class="fs-16 fw-bold text-black day-label">Tuesday 10 Nov</div><div class="screening-grid mt-2 mb-4"><!-- OPEN screening-grid --><div class="col-5 col-md-3 screening-card border me-2 text-center d-flex mb-2 flex-column justify-content-between d-2026-11-10 genredrama cert-certificatepg" data-date="2026-11-10"><div class="px-3 pt-2 bg-white flex-grow-1"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase text-black fs-16 fs-md-18">7:30 pm</h5><div class="text-black fs-14 fw-semibold lh-sm">Screen 7</div><div class="text-black fs-14 lh-sm mb-3 tags">Recliner, AD</div></div><a href="https://vivenu.com/event/6ac8aebe1a4d0526e45a38b7" class="btn text-white fw-bold rounded-0 border-0 w-100 py-2 btn-primary cta">Book Now</a></div><!-- /screening-card --></div><!-- /.screening-grid --></div></div><!-- /.day-block --></div><!-- /.film-days --></div><!-- /col-lg-6 --><!-- Session Key --><div class="col-md-3 col-12 mt-3 mt-md-0 d-flex flex-column"><div class="session-key-wrapper d-flex flex-column mt-auto"><button class="session-toggle btn fw-bold text-uppercase px-4 py-2 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sessionKey636" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sessionKey636">Key</button><div id="sessionKey636" class="session-key-panel border bg-white px-3 py-3 fs-14 lh-sm collapse"><div class="mb-1"><strong>AD</strong> - Audio described.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Sub</strong> - Subtitled.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - No ads, lights up, sound low.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Flash</strong> - Flash / strobe effects.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>Recliner</strong> - Premium recliner seats.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>ATMOS</strong> - Dolby Atmos surround sound.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>4K</strong> - 4K image projection.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>3D</strong> - 3D presentation.</div><div class="mb-1"><strong>FL Sub</strong> - Foreign language with English subtitles.</div></div></div></div></div><!-- /row --></div><!-- /.container --></section><!-- /section (END show) --><section class="wrapper bg-light movie item w-100" data-nextscreening="2026-11-23 18:40:00"><!-- OPEN show --><div class="container py-10"><!-- OPEN container --><div class="row gx-md-8 gx-xl-12"><!-- OPEN row --><!-- Poster --><div class="col-lg-3 d-none d-lg-block"><!-- OPEN poster col --><figure class="overlay overlay-1 hover-scale rounded-0"><a href="/shows/doctor-who-the-satan-pit.html"><img src="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/thumbs/lkeFRUE6TMR5jLj4VamLA1jXl3M.jpg" srcset="/cmsUploads/tmdbimage/images/lkeFRUE6TMR5jLj4VamLA1jXl3M.jpg" alt="Doctor Who: The Satan Pit" /><span class="bg"></span></a></figure></div><!-- /col-lg-3 --><!-- Text + days --><div clas